:"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, this county&rsquo;s record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years. In 2025, September to October on the middle of the grids came in at 59% of normal. Grid 31368 had its driest year in 1963, at 66% of normal.</p>"}
